(7615281, 1232737, 65234, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s in jail. Not sure what I think about the selective desat ... especially her lips. She looks a bit young for lipstick and the color doesn''t match the intensity of the rest of the red in the scene. And my eye gets drawn to the other patches of red, and I''m not sure what that adds to her story.</td>', 'She looks like she''s in jail. Not sure what I think about the selective desat ... especially her lips. She looks a bit young for lipstick and the color doesn''t match the intensity of the rest of the red in the scene. And my eye gets drawn to the other patches of red, and I''m not sure what that adds to her story.', '2019-02-24 09:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
