(7616128, 1232737, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like you composition but would prefer pure b&amp;w.  Her pale skin and blonde hair pops agains the dark background.</td>', 'I like you composition but would prefer pure b&w.  Her pale skin and blonde hair pops agains the dark background.', '2019-03-01 00:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616129, 1232522, 16148, '<td valign="top">The crop, cutting off the tree, is brilliant.  Plenty of room to make the story our own.  At some point, we start paying attention, we see things that will happen to us all.</td>', 'The crop, cutting off the tree, is brilliant.  Plenty of room to make the story our own.  At some point, we start paying attention, we see things that will happen to us all.', '2019-03-01 00:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
