(7616131, 1232538, 114285, '<td valign="top">WOW where was dinner did you say??<br/> <br/>I have dreams of wrestling my camera out of my camera bag often, seeing the most amazing images in my dreams and never able to capture them. When it occurs in real life it''s such a thrill to snap that one image that blows you away. Congrats!</td>', 'WOW where was dinner did you say?? I have dreams of wrestling my camera out of my camera bag often, seeing the most amazing images in my dreams and never able to capture them. When it occurs in real life it''s such a thrill to snap that one image that blows you away. Congrats!', '2019-03-01 00:26:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616132, 1232989, 16148, '<td valign="top">So many personalities cascading down the steps.  Terrific candid moment!  Always a pleasure to see your work.</td>', 'So many personalities cascading down the steps.  Terrific candid moment!  Always a pleasure to see your work.', '2019-03-01 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616133, 1232797, 114285, '<td valign="top">Totally 100% adorable Paul.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the red in a ''best of'' not too shabby :)</td>', 'Totally 100% adorable Paul. Congrats on the red in a ''best of'' not too shabby :)', '2019-03-01 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
