(7616142, 1232797, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is truly stunning .. sorry i made the SaraR assumption .. similar sheep and similar title .. <br/>anyway .. this is so deserving of the ribbon .. congratulations .. absolutely loving the minimalistic feel .. :)<br/></td>', 'this is truly stunning .. sorry i made the SaraR assumption .. similar sheep and similar title .. anyway .. this is so deserving of the ribbon .. congratulations .. absolutely loving the minimalistic feel .. :)', '2019-03-01 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616144, 1232990, 67145, '<td valign="top">i really cant believe this didnt come at least in the top 10 .. at least .. <br/>another example of whattha .. <br/>anyway .. this was one i actually thought might ribbon even with some of the other stunning entries .. <br/>but then i love black and white .. and candids of life on the street .. <br/>re the perspective .. to me that didnt detract at all .. its like you are seeing the view from an angle almost ... sometimes not totally square works better .. altho having said that being cool is way better .. ;)</td>', 'i really cant believe this didnt come at least in the top 10 .. at least .. another example of whattha .. anyway .. this was one i actually thought might ribbon even with some of the other stunning entries .. but then i love black and white .. and candids of life on the street .. re the perspective .. to me that didnt detract at all .. its like you are seeing the view from an angle almost ... sometimes not totally square works better .. altho having said that being cool is way better .. ;)', '2019-03-01 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616151, 1233025, 109387, '<td valign="top">The King of lightnings! So glad to see you back my friend and huge congrats on your win!</td>', 'The King of lightnings! So glad to see you back my friend and huge congrats on your win!', '2019-03-01 01:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616163, 1232538, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red. One of my top votes and this image has so much going for it. It has a dinner feel to it, the end of a hectic day. Shut down time. Good on you for having your camera and grabbing the moment when it counted. It is this attitude that frustrates every non photographer.. including my family</td>', 'Congrats on the Red. One of my top votes and this image has so much going for it. It has a dinner feel to it, the end of a hectic day. Shut down time. Good on you for having your camera and grabbing the moment when it counted. It is this attitude that frustrates every non photographer.. including my family', '2019-03-01 02:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616164, 1233044, 16148, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly caught and presented.  Love those three hats from above.</td>', 'Brilliantly caught and presented.  Love those three hats from above.', '2019-03-01 02:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616165, 1232797, 86218, '<td valign="top">Great image Paul. It had your style written all over it and knew it was yours. Congrats on the Yellow<br/></td>', 'Great image Paul. It had your style written all over it and knew it was yours. Congrats on the Yellow', '2019-03-01 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616168, 1233069, 86218, '<td valign="top">I guessed this to be yours sir!! Fantastic image with one of my top votes. Looks like a painting with everything perfected exactly as the artist would want it..only nature gifted this to you as your technical skills stepped up to realise this image. Congrats!</td>', 'I guessed this to be yours sir!! Fantastic image with one of my top votes. Looks like a painting with everything perfected exactly as the artist would want it..only nature gifted this to you as your technical skills stepped up to realise this image. Congrats!', '2019-03-01 02:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616178, 1232673, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nam:</b></div><hr/><i> A beautiful girl, great focus and tones.  I''m having trouble with the pose - whose arms are these, anyway?  Clearly the forward arm is hers, and I guess the other is, too . . .   but there''s something very strange about the very straight edge of her forearm. I like the spots of sunlight though the one on the bridge of her nose is distracting.  Can''t get away from those eyes, though . . . so it''s an 8 from me.  Voted earlier. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Nikki, all hands are hers :). Actually, after  looking at this shot I tried to make the same pose... no way. For her it was absolutely natural and spontaneous, I did not direct her. I guess she is just way more flexible than me :). I do like this unusual pose, I think it frames her face very well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-03-01 16:34:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by nam: A beautiful girl, great focus and tones.  I''m having trouble with the pose - whose arms are these, anyway?  Clearly the forward arm is hers, and I guess the other is, too . . .   but there''s something very strange about the very straight edge of her forearm. I like the spots of sunlight though the one on the bridge of her nose is distracting.  Can''t get away from those eyes, though . . . so it''s an 8 from me.  Voted earlier.  Nikki, all hands are hers :). Actually, after  looking at this shot I tried to make the same pose... no way. For her it was absolutely natural and spontaneous, I did not direct her. I guess she is just way more flexible than me :). I do like this unusual pose, I think it frames her face very well.', '2019-03-01 02:58:27.000000', '2019-03-01 16:34:08.000000', 0),
(7616184, 1232538, 97225, '<td valign="top">One shot was all you needed! Congratulations on the red.</td>', 'One shot was all you needed! Congratulations on the red.', '2019-03-01 04:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616208, 1233025, 135744, '<td valign="top">This is truly amazing! I am petrified of thunder and lightning so this would be my worst nightmare and the last thing on my mind would be to take a camera out. So hats off to you for your bravery. And more importantly congrats on the blue for this incredible image.</td>', 'This is truly amazing! I am petrified of thunder and lightning so this would be my worst nightmare and the last thing on my mind would be to take a camera out. So hats off to you for your bravery. And more importantly congrats on the blue for this incredible image.', '2019-03-01 07:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616210, 1232538, 135744, '<td valign="top">This is a superb photo and certainly deserved a ribbon. I bet it would do well on a stock library. And you took this while sat in a restaurant - did I understand that correctly? If so that''s even more amazing. I thought you must have been in another cable car. Congrats!</td>', 'This is a superb photo and certainly deserved a ribbon. I bet it would do well on a stock library. And you took this while sat in a restaurant - did I understand that correctly? If so that''s even more amazing. I thought you must have been in another cable car. Congrats!', '2019-03-01 07:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616237, 1233025, 112739, '<td valign="top">Happy to see your work here again Rian! You are a brave, brave person! I''m sure the trip was one for the memory books. Congratulations on a big win!</td>', 'Happy to see your work here again Rian! You are a brave, brave person! I''m sure the trip was one for the memory books. Congratulations on a big win!', '2019-03-01 09:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616238, 1233069, 112739, '<td valign="top">Yep, knew was yours Alessandro. Your waiting in the water has paid off once more. Congrats!</td>', 'Yep, knew was yours Alessandro. Your waiting in the water has paid off once more. Congrats!', '2019-03-01 09:59:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616242, 1232538, 112739, '<td valign="top">I also thought you were in an adjacent cable car working the timing just right. Either way, you released the shutter at the exact right moment. Catching the sun through the cable car really makes this image stand out. Congrats on the red!</td>', 'I also thought you were in an adjacent cable car working the timing just right. Either way, you released the shutter at the exact right moment. Catching the sun through the cable car really makes this image stand out. Congrats on the red!', '2019-03-01 10:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7616244, 1232797, 112739, '<td valign="top">Lydia nailed your ending position! Truly a Paul image! You have the touch with finding and capturing these special moments.</td>', 'Lydia nailed your ending position! Truly a Paul image! You have the touch with finding and capturing these special moments.', '2019-03-01 10:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
